# Cloudflare Pages redirects. www to apex is a Redirect Rule in the dashboard,
# because _redirects cannot match on hostname.
#
# The old redirect stubs brand-system.html and index/index.html must be deleted
# at cutover. With them present, Cloudflare's extensionless URLs are ambiguous
# next to brand-system/index.html and can loop.
/brand-system.html  /brand-system/  301
/index.html         /               301
/index              /               301
/index/             /               301
